// First `Blink` authored as a real *player spell*. Every prior `Blink` RON is
// either a racial innate (`innate/danari.ron`, "Shadowstep") or an
// NPC/monster teleport (vampire/*, custom/*/teleport.ron,
// custom/mindflayer/dimensionaldoor.ron). `danari.ron` is the closest usable
// template: it's the only other player-triggered `Blink`, and confirms the
// variant has NO `energy_cost` field (see `CharacterAbility::Blink` in
// common/src/comp/ability.rs) -- it is free by nature, so cooldown is the
// only balance lever available.
//
// Closest 1:1 sheet match of this batch's three Blink spells: the sheet
// already just says "the caster slips out of one spot and reappears a short
// dash away", which is exactly what `Blink` does (common/src/states/blink.rs)
// -- no rider dropped here. `frontend_specifier` is left `None`: the only two
// options (`CultistFlame`, `FlameThrower`) are both fire-flavored and would
// misrepresent this spell's misty theme; no new VFX asset is added.
Blink(
    buildup_duration: 0.3,
    recover_duration: 0.2,
    max_range: 9.0,
    frontend_specifier: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane), cooldown: Some(10.0)),
)
